## Chunk Plan

| Chunk | NUM_DAYS | YEARS_OFFSET | Covers |
|-------|----------|--------------|--------|
| 1 | 365 | 6 | Year 6 ago |
| 2 | 365 | 5 | Year 5 ago |
| 3 | 365 | 4 | Year 4 ago |
| 4 | 365 | 3 | Year 3 ago |
| 5 | 365 | 2 | Year 2 ago |
| 6 | 365 | 1 | Year 1 ago |

